description: JB steering rules (mirror of CLAUDE.md)
alwaysApply: true
---
Read Plan.md sections 7 and 8 and docs/DECISIONS.md before changing any schema, route, shared type, or db collection. Pull before you start. Respect ownership from Plan.md section 10: market pair (Nico, Aditya) owns services/market, routers/market.py, the websocket hub, the compliance and portfolio agents, and tests; platform pair (Vir, Zhiyuan) owns apps/web, packages/contracts, services/discovery, db.py, identity.py, llm.py, migrations, seeds, deploy and docs. Contract changes need a DECISIONS.md entry, regenerated openapi.yaml and types.ts via ./scripts/gen_contract.sh, and a commit prefixed "contract:". Grok and K2 are called from the app only, never used to write code. No em dashes in docs or UI copy.

Every route in Plan.md section 7 exists as a stub returning packages/contracts/examples/*.json; replace the body and keep the signature. All model calls go through app/llm.py. Indexes and seed documents belong in migrations/, never in application startup. Every row referencing a person stores users._id, never a name or subject string; do not branch on auth provider outside app/identity.py. Run the API with one uvicorn worker because the websocket hub and batch scheduler are in process singletons.
